Governance files at the repository root — CLA.md, CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md,
CONTRIBUTING.md and this NOTICE — carry no licence assertion of their own:
quote, fork and adapt them freely. (CLA.md is the Apache ICLA v2.0, which
