DEPLOYMENT IDENTITY
===================

A deployment's apex domain is configuration, supplied by the environment, not
a value baked into this project. It is also load-bearing: the passkey relying-
party id is derived from it, so changing the apex strands every passkey already
registered against the old one. Pick it once per deployment.

See docs/licensing.md, "Deployment identity", for the detail.


